###### SHADOW-PROBLEM — endpoint yang jelek/buruk secara kode saat ini ######
### JANGAN dipakai untuk flow normal. File ini untuk membuktikan temuan audit
### branch shadow (lihat AUDIT-SHADOW-KODE.md, kode B1-B16) sebelum diperbaiki.
### Tiap blok menjelaskan KENAPA JELEK + lokasi kode sumber.
### Urutan coba yang disarankan: B2 → B1 → B8/B4 → B5/B6/B7 → B12 → rute mati.


### ========================================
### B2 (TINGGI) — Jalur uang ganda: pelunasan manual invoice tanpa Payment record
### Lokasi: invoice-core InvoiceController.applyPayment + DevRoleSeeder (kasir pegang invoice.update)
### Efek: sales.billing bergerak, sales.cash DIAM → dashboard terlihat "uang hilang".
### Keputusan yang ditunggu: tutup/ketatkan endpoint ini, atau jadikan koreksi admin saja.
### ========================================

### B2: pelunasan manual parsial — kas tidak bergerak, cek dashboard lalu bandingkan sales.cash vs sales.billing
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "amount": 20000
}

### B2: cek invoice-nya (status berubah, tapi tidak ada Payment record baru di GET /payments?targetId=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### B1 (TINGGI) — Refund parsial: kas dicatat penuh, tagihan dikoreksi sebagian
### Lokasi: payment-core PaymentService.markRefunded + PaymentEventPublisherService.publishRefunded
###   (refundedAmount = payment.getAmount() penuh) vs invoice Refund.scopeAmount (parsial)
### Efek: sales.cash.refunded > sales.billing.refundedAmount untuk satu kejadian yang sama.
### ========================================

### B1: refund parsial 1 item dari payment yang menutup 2+ item
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "orderItemIds": [2]
}

### B1: bandingkan dua basis refund di dashboard (cash.refunded vs billing.refundedAmount)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### B8 (SEDANG) — Refund penuh menyisakan invoice OPEN dengan total 0, order boleh diubah lagi
### Lokasi: invoice-core Invoice.applyRefund → markOpen, hasAppliedPayment
### Seharusnya: invoice yang seluruh barisnya direfund = VOID, bukan OPEN total 0.
### ========================================

### B8: refund full (tanpa body) atas invoice 1 item
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/refund
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### B8: invoice-nya — perhatikan status OPEN dengan totalAmount 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### B8: order-nya masih bisa diubah (seharusnya ditolak karena uang pernah masuk)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "notes": "seharusnya invoice VOID, bukan OPEN 0"
}


### ========================================
### B4 (SEDANG) — Fakta pelunasan bergeser: lunas → refund → lunas lagi pindah periode
### Lokasi: invoice-core Invoice.markPaid (selalu menimpa paid_at/settled_amount)
### Dashboard periode lama kehilangan faktanya. Belum ada test siklus ini.
### ========================================

### B4: lunasi ulang invoice yang tadi di-refund penuh (pakai jalur kasir yang benar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1,
    "paymentProvider": "INTERNAL",
    "paymentDetail": "re-pay setelah refund"
}

### B4: cek paid_at/settledAmount invoice — menimpa fakta pelunasan sebelumnya
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### B5/B6/B7 (SEDANG) — Angka dashboard yang mudah disalahbaca
### B5: recentActivity.totalPrice = total ORDER, billingStatus = status INVOICE (dua objek satu baris)
### B6: topMenus = BRUTO (refund tidak mengurangi qty/revenue menu)
### B7: outstandingInvoices/Amount = SNAPSHOT hari ini, tetangganya per periode
### Lokasi: report-core ReportServiceImpl + InvoiceReportRepository.findMenuSalesBetween
### ========================================

### B5/B6/B7: tarik dashboard lalu baca dengan curiga —
### recentActivity[].totalPrice vs billingStatus, topMenus vs refundedAmount, outstanding vs periode
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### B12 (RENDAH): periode masa depan diterima → semua nol tanpa peringatan (seolah "tidak ada penjualan")
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard/summary?from=2099-01-01&to=2099-01-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### RUTE MATI — sudah tidak ada di controller (ekspektasi 404/405)
### Dulu ada di payment.http sebagai blok DEPRECATED; dipindah ke sini supaya
### payment.http hanya berisi modul payment saat ini. Lokasi: PaymentController
### (tanpa pay/PUT/PATCH/DELETE) + PaymentPutRequest/PatchRequest sudah dihapus.
### ========================================

### MATI: POST /payments/{id}/pay (status hanya via webhook Xendit / provider INTERNAL saat create)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### MATI: PUT /payments/{id}
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "targetType": "INVOICE",
    "targetId": 1
}

### MATI: PATCH /payments/{id}
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paymentDetail": "0000987654321"
}

### MATI: DELETE /payments/{id}
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/payments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
